  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28f310e05cc019a48855581da30b411e, type: 3}
  m_Name: BicolHistory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: 'Spicy, creamy, and named after a train. '
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: "Bicol Express earns its heat honestly, with \u201Csiling labuyo\u201D and \u201Csiling haba\u201D bringing,"
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: "fire while \u201Cgata\u201D and \u201Cbagoong alamang\u201D bring comfort.  "
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: The story, a Manila cook in the 1970s renamed an older Bicolano,
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: 'chili-and coconut tradition after the overnight train that carried travelers between Manila and Legazpi. '
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: Can you balance the heat with the richness without ever breaking the delicate  coconut cream?
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
